.TH MAOLAN-GENERATE 1 "2026-11-25" "maolan-generate" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
maolan-generate \- generate music and MIDI from text prompts
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B maolan-generate
.RI [ options ]
.I prompt-or-lyrics
.br
.B maolan-generate
.B \-\-decode-only
.BI \-\-frames-json " path"
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B maolan-generate
generates audio with HeartMuLa or ACE-Step 1.5, and Standard MIDI Files with
the deterministic text-to-MIDI generator or MIDI-LLM.
Model files are downloaded from Hugging Face on first use unless a local model
directory is supplied.
.PP
The default model is
.B happy-new-year
and the default backend is
.BR vulkan .
Audio is written as WAV and MIDI output is written as a Standard MIDI File.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print command-line help and exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-model " name"
Select the generation model.
Supported names are
.BR happy-new-year ,
.BR RL ,
.BR acestep-turbo ,
.BR acestep-sft ,
.BR text-to-midi ,
and
.BR midi-llm .
.TP
.BI \-\-model-dir " path"
Load model files from a local directory instead of resolving them through the
Hugging Face cache.
.TP
.BI \-\-output " path"
Set the output WAV or MIDI path.
The default is
.BR output.wav .
.TP
.B \-\-inspect
Inspect model assets without generating output.
For text-to-MIDI models, print generator information instead.
.TP
.BI \-\-backend " cpu|vulkan"
Select the CPU or Vulkan runtime backend.
.TP
.BI \-\-lyrics " text"
Set the prompt or lyrics explicitly.
A positional prompt is also accepted.
.TP
.BI \-\-tags " text"
Set comma-separated style tags for HeartMuLa.
.TP
.BI \-\-cfg-scale " float"
Set HeartMuLa classifier-free guidance scale.
A value of 1.0 disables guidance, 2.0 gives weak guidance, and 6.0 gives strong
guidance.
The default is 1.5.
.TP
.BI \-\-length " milliseconds"
Set HeartMuLa or ACE-Step output length in milliseconds.
The default is 6000.
.TP
.BI \-\-topk " integer"
Set HeartMuLa top-k sampling.
The value must be greater than zero.
The default is 50.
.TP
.BI \-\-temperature " float"
Set HeartMuLa or MIDI-LLM sampling temperature.
The value must be finite and non-negative.
The default is 1.0.
.TP
.BI \-\-ode-steps " integer"
Set the number of HeartMuLa flow-matching steps.
Use 5 for faster generation, 10 for the default quality, or 20 for higher
quality.
.TP
.BI \-\-decoder-seed " integer"
Set the seed for deterministic HeartCodec decoder latents.
The default is 0.
.TP
.B \-\-decode-only
Decode an existing HeartMuLa frames JSON file instead of generating tokens.
Requires
.BR \-\-frames-json .
.TP
.BI \-\-frames-json " path"
Set the frames JSON input used by
.BR \-\-decode-only .
.TP
.BI \-\-decode-threads " integer"
Set the number of worker threads for decode-only CPU decoding.
.TP
.BI \-\-bpm " float"
Set the tempo in beats per minute for ACE-Step, text-to-MIDI, or MIDI-LLM.
The supported range is 20 through 400.
MIDI generation defaults to 120 BPM.
.TP
.BI \-\-key-scale " text"
Set the musical key for ACE-Step or text-to-MIDI, for example
.B C major
or
.BR "A minor" .
.TP
.BI \-\-time-signature " N/D"
Set the time signature for ACE-Step, text-to-MIDI, or MIDI-LLM, for example
.B 4/4
or
.BR 6/8 .
.TP
.BI \-\-acestep-lm " 0.6B|1.7B|4B"
Select the ACE-Step language-model planner size.
ACE-Step SFT uses the 4B planner.
.TP
.BI \-\-midi-length " seconds"
Set deterministic text-to-MIDI output length.
The value must be positive and finite.
The default is 10.
.TP
.BI \-\-midi-seed " integer"
Set the seed for deterministic text-to-MIDI or MIDI-LLM output.
The default is 0.
.TP
.BI \-\-midi-max-tokens " integer"
Set the maximum number of MIDI-LLM music tokens to generate.
The value must be greater than zero.
The default is 1024.
.TP
.BI \-\-midi-top-p " float"
Set the MIDI-LLM top-p nucleus-sampling threshold.
The value must be between 0 and 1.
The default is 0.98.
.SH EXAMPLES
Generate HeartMuLa audio with explicit style tags:
.PP
.nf
.RS
maolan-generate --tags "ambient, cinematic" --output ambient.wav \\
  "stars drift over the late train home"
.RE
.fi
.PP
Generate an instrumental ACE-Step track:
.PP
.nf
.RS
maolan-generate --model acestep-turbo --backend vulkan --bpm 128 \\
  --key-scale "A minor" --time-signature 4/4 --length 10000 \\
  --output loop.wav "dark rolling techno groove"
.RE
.fi
.PP
Generate MIDI without downloading a model:
.PP
.nf
.RS
maolan-generate --model text-to-midi --bpm 128 --midi-length 10 \\
  --output loop.mid "dark rolling techno bassline"
.RE
.fi
.PP
Decode previously generated HeartMuLa frames:
.PP
.nf
.RS
maolan-generate --decode-only --frames-json output.frames.json \\
  --output output.wav
.RE
.fi
.SH FILES
.TP
.I output.wav
Default output path.
.TP
.I output.frames.json
Default location for intermediate HeartMuLa frames when the output path is
.BR output.wav .
.SH NOTES
Vulkan generation requires a working Vulkan driver.
CPU generation is supported through the Burn flex backend.
Model downloads and local model layouts are described in the project README.
